        "body": "<p>Oakland's economy is powered by construction, logistics, tech, and creative industries — and our shipping containers support them all. We've delivered units to industrial yards in West Oakland, contractors in Hayward, growers in the Central Valley, and vendors at events in Walnut Creek and San Jose.</p><p>Common uses include:</p><ul><li>On-site storage for construction crews in the East Bay</li><li>Overflow inventory for retailers in Alameda and Fremont</li><li>Agricultural equipment storage for small farms in Livermore and Brentwood</li><li>Temporary storage for film and event crews in downtown Oakland or San Jose</li></ul><p>Our 20ft, 40ft, and high cube containers are chosen by customers who need flexible, weatherproof space on demand. Whether you need secure job-site storage in Concord or want to expand your small business capacity in San Ramon, we've got the right container — and the logistics — to make it happen.</p><p>Plus, with multiple condition types available (WWT, CW, One-Trip), Oakland-area customers can balance budget and performance needs with ease.</p>",
