        "f2": { "type": "faq", "settings": { "question": "Do I need a permit to place a shipping container on my Oakland property?", "answer": "<p>In most residential areas of Oakland, short-term placement of a container on private property doesn't require a permit. However, placement on a public street, sidewalk, or in a commercial zone may require a temporary use or encroachment permit. Always check with the Oakland Planning Department or your HOA before delivery.</p>" } },
